{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12233090","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12233090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1223309001:0":{"text":"アーロンか？なかなか上手くやったな。ハエは自作自演だろ？","source_cn":"是阿隆啊？小动作还挺熟练，苍蝇是你粘的吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF34602ACA033F7C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1223309002:0":{"text":"黙れ！そいつらの助けがなかったら、今頃お前たちは廃業してたんだ！","source_cn":"少废话！要不是你们有帮手，今天让你们从开业变破产！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D043133E455B71F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1223309003:0":{"text":"……お前らをよこしたのはレナータだな。じゃあ強盗もそうか？","source_cn":"……是雷纳塔让你们来的吧。货也是你们劫的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AE79732A4565151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1223309004:0":{"text":"そこのお節介なメイジがいなければ、お前らのような軟弱野郎をラスティーアンカーから消してやったぜ！","source_cn":"嘁，要不是这碍事的魔法师，今天我要你们这帮软皮蛇消失在...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x684C2B01F4505529","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"そこのお節介なメイジがいなければ、お前らのような軟弱野郎をラスティーアンカーから消してやったぜ！","female":"そこのお節介なメイジがいなければ、お前らのような軟弱野郎をラスティーアンカーから消してやったぜ！","variant_male_record_index":"138525","variant_female_record_index":"138526","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1223309005:1":{"text":"あれ？やっぱりお前らか？それで誰が軟弱だって！？","source_cn":"哈！？原来是你们？你叫谁软皮蛇？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B46CAF1F0A81438","variant_sta